## Manual Steps After Opening in Unity Editor

1. Let Unity regenerate `.meta` files and import packages
2. Re-assign C# scripts to scene GameObjects in Inspector
3. Set AR Plane prefab on ARPlaneManager component
4. Verify `Edit > Project Settings > XR Plug-in Management` → ARCore checked
5. Export as AAR → copy to `app/libs/`
